{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FRUITOPIA, a quiet world, without fuss, inhabited by FRUIX and VEGANS.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One day, everything changes and the two clans have a blast...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Live in this original world, in a universe where fierce battles become one!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LOOT: Loot, crates to search in different maps where you can find many objects, weapons, health, armor, etc... Essential to your survival!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SURVIVE: Stand until time runs out by assisting or fighting against your opponents.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WIN: Be number one in the game to enrage your enemies!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On your weapons for the next round!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3370370?t=1742045406","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370370/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742045406","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370370/f678f933fa30b89d342f8807846c1de1a293ac26/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742045406","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370370/f678f933fa30b89d342f8807846c1de1a293ac26/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742045406","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FRUITOPIA, a quiet world, without fuss, inhabited by FRUIX and VEGANS.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One day, everything changes and the two clans have a blast...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Live in this original world, in a universe where fierce battles become one!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LOOT: Loot, crates to search in different maps where you can find many objects, weapons, health, armor, etc... Essential to your survival!